{"id":"f032216255883436","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-recursion4-schnorr-test.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Schnorr Test","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-schnorr-test — ZFC Recursion4 Schnorr Test","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-schnorr-test","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-schnorr-test"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-schnorr-test — ZFC Recursion4 Schnorr Test","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-schnorr-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-schnorr-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-schnorr-test — ZFC Recursion4 Schnorr Test"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da0bcf2e3f060472\" href=\"?note=da0bcf2e3f060472\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md\">../batch07/58-df-recursive.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" href=\"?note=7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec U,q,\\Sigma_C,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\vec U,q,\\Sigma_C,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]=\\{x\\in2^\\omega:\\sigma\\subseteq x\\}\">\\([\\sigma]=\\{x\\in2^\\omega:\\sigma\\subseteq x\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_C=\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\})\">\\(\\Sigma_C=\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\})\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the probability-space, total-recursive-class, and set-function predicates</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4SchnorrTest}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4SchnorrTest}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（本文件定义）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a7e1b630ead60caa\" href=\"?note=a7e1b630ead60caa\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md\">../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md</a> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle n,k\\rangle_\\omega=\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,k)\">\\(\\langle n,k\\rangle_\\omega=\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,k)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rat}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\in\\mathbb Q^\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{rat}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\in\\mathbb Q^\\omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniformlyC.e.Open}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{UniformlyC.e.Open}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 在下式定义；保留原有名称。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" href=\"?note=7b1ff54ac76ee59d\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}schnorr\\text{-}test} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4SchnorrTest}_S(\\vec U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\exists\\Sigma_C,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma_C=\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\})\\land\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(2^\\omega,\\Sigma_C,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\lambda([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\omega,\\mathcal P(2^\\omega))\\land\n\\operatorname{UniformlyC.e.Open}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\vec U)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec U(n)\\in\\Sigma_C\\land\\lambda(\\vec U(n))\\leq2^{-n})\\land\n\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(q,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\n\\forall n,k\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left|\\operatorname{rat}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\!\\left(q(\\langle n,k\\rangle_\\omega)\\right)-\\lambda(\\vec U(n))\\right|\n\\leq 2^{-k}\n\\right)\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}schnorr\\text{-}test} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4SchnorrTest}_S(\\vec U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\exists\\Sigma_C,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Sigma_C=\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\})\\land\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(2^\\omega,\\Sigma_C,\\lambda)\\land\n\\forall\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\lambda([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\omega,\\mathcal P(2^\\omega))\\land\n\\operatorname{UniformlyC.e.Open}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\vec U)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec U(n)\\in\\Sigma_C\\land\\lambda(\\vec U(n))\\leq2^{-n})\\land\n\\exists q\\in\\mathrm{Rec}\\cap\\omega^\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(q,\\omega,\\omega)\\land\n\\forall n,k\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left|\\operatorname{rat}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\!\\left(q(\\langle n,k\\rangle_\\omega)\\right)-\\lambda(\\vec U(n))\\right|\n\\leq 2^{-k}\n\\right)\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\operatorname{rat}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)\\right)\n=\\frac{(-1)^a\\lfloor a/2\\rfloor}{b+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\operatorname{rat}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(a,b)\\right)\n=\\frac{(-1)^a\\lfloor a/2\\rfloor}{b+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{UniformlyC.e.Open}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\vec U)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\omega,\\mathcal P(2^\\omega))\\land\n\\exists W\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\vec U(n)=\\bigcup\\bigl\\{[s]:s\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s))\\in W\\bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{UniformlyC.e.Open}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\vec U)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\omega,\\mathcal P(2^\\omega))\\land\n\\exists W\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}_S(W)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\vec U(n)=\\bigcup\\bigl\\{[s]:s\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}(s))\\in W\\bigr\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>测试仍取 Cantor 空间上的公平硬币测度；未把 Schnorr 测试改为 Martin–Löf 测试。可计算测度近似与一致 c.e. 开性分别由两个明确编码条件给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-recursive.md","status":"resolved","id":"da0bcf2e3f060472","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-recursive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"7b1ff54ac76ee59d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7e1b630ead60caa","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}$、$\\operatorname{SeqCode}_{58}$ 由 [[../batch08/58-df-effective-program-coding.md]] 定义；$\\langle n,k\\rangle_\\omega=\\operatorname{NatPair}_{58}(n,k)$。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"7b1ff54ac76ee59d","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZfcCompComputablyEnumerableSet}$ 取 [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comp-computably-enumerable-set.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vec U,q,\\Sigma_C,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"[\\sigma]=\\{x\\in2^\\omega:\\sigma\\subseteq x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_C=\\sigma_{2^\\omega}(\\{[\\sigma]:\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySp